  m_text: 'The player controls an energetic ball that strives to go as far as possible,
    overcoming various obstacles. By tapping the screen, the player makes the ball
    jump over cars and other obstacles encountered along the way. Collect coins to
    earn points. With each obstacle passed, the difficulty increases, adding new
    challenges and dynamics to the game. Have time to show reaction and agility to
    set a new record!  '
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7659f6d6ec9b642db8be29bc45fe97cc, type: 2}
